Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Wiki|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Add Child Page Format Media Wiki
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|osgi.app.includes|wiki-engine-mediawiki|
	When these properties
		|test.assert.warning.exceptions|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And Click at locator 'Button#PLUS'
	And WikiEntry select Page Format
		|pageFormat|MediaWiki|
	And WikiEntry confirm Media Wiki
	And WikiEntry add Page Title
		|wikiPageTitle|MediaWiki Page Title|
	And WikiEntry add Media Wiki Description
		|wikiPageContent|''MediaWiki Page Content''|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And WikiNavigator goto CP
		|wikiPageTitle|MediaWiki Page Title|
	And WikiNavigator goto Add Child Page Via CP
	And WikiEntry select Page Format
		|pageFormat|MediaWiki|
	And WikiEntry confirm Media Wiki
	And WikiEntry add Page Title
		|wikiPageTitle|MediaWiki Child Page Title|
	And WikiEntry add Media Wiki Description
		|wikiPageContent|''MediaWiki Child Page Content''|
	And PortletEntry publish
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Wiki|
	And WikiNavigator goto Node
		|wikiNodeName|Main|
	And WikiNavigator goto CP
		|wikiPageTitle|MediaWiki Page Title|
	And WikiNavigator goto Child Page CP
		|wikiChildPageContent|MediaWiki Child Page Content|
		|wikiChildPageTitle|MediaWiki Child Page Title|
	Then WikiEntry view Page Content Body
		|wikiPageContent|MediaWiki Child Page Content|

